---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Lønn og rapportering" activeNav="treasury">
  <main class="pay-shell">
    <section class="pay-hero"><div><span class="eyebrow">Styr.ing · lønn og lovpålagt kontroll</span><h1>Forbered tallene.<br /><em>Godkjenn før de går.</em></h1><p>Beregn feriepenger og OTP, klargjør rapporteringsgrunnlag og hold menneskelig kontroll før noe kan sendes til Altinn eller NAV.</p><a class="primary" href="#pay-work">Åpne lønnskontrollen ↓</a></div><div class="pay-orb"><strong id="pay-total">—</strong><span>ferie + OTP</span><small id="pay-status">Henter…</small></div></section>
    <section class="metrics"><article><span>Feriepenger</span><strong id="pay-holiday">—</strong><small id="pay-holiday-rate">—</small></article><article><span>OTP</span><strong id="pay-otp">—</strong><small id="pay-otp-rate">—</small></article><article><span>Netto lønn</span><strong id="pay-net">—</strong><small>brutto minus skattetrekk</small></article><article class="dark"><span>Arbeidsgiverkostnad</span><strong id="pay-employer">—</strong><small id="pay-people">— ansatte i grunnlaget</small></article></section>
    <section id="pay-work" class="workspace"><div class="head"><div><span class="kicker">Kontrollspor</span><h2>Lønnskjøring og innsending</h2></div><span id="status">Henter…</span></div><nav class="tabs"><button class="active" data-view="checks">Beregninger</button><button data-view="runs">Lønnskjøringer</button><button data-view="submissions">Innsendinger</button></nav><div id="pay-list"></div></section>
    <section class="actions"><div><span class="kicker">Kontrollert klargjøring</span><h2>Gjør neste lønnskjøring klar.</h2><p>Handlingene krever eier- eller redaktørrolle. De oppretter beregning og payload-hash, men sender aldri direkte til offentlig myndighet.</p></div><div class="action-grid">
      <form id="create-run-form"><strong>Opprett lønnskjøring</strong><label>Periode<input name="period" pattern="\d{4}-(0[1-9]|1[0-2])" required placeholder="2026-09" /></label><label>Brutto lønn i kroner<input name="gross" type="number" min="0.01" step="0.01" required placeholder="45 000,00" /></label><div class="form-row"><label>Skattetrekk i kroner<input name="tax" type="number" min="0" step="0.01" value="0" required /></label><label>Arbeidsgiverkostnad inkl. avgift<input name="employer" type="number" min="0.01" step="0.01" required placeholder="51 300,00" /></label></div><label>Antall ansatte<input name="employees" type="number" min="1" step="1" required placeholder="1" /></label><button type="submit">Opprett som utkast</button><small>Inkluder arbeidsgiveravgift og andre kostnader du vil bokføre. Ingen lønn utbetales eller sendes.</small></form>
      <form id="calculate-form"><strong>Beregn feriepenger og OTP</strong><label>Lønnskjøring<select id="run-select" name="runId" required></select></label><label>Feriesats<input name="holidayRate" type="number" min="0" max="1" step="0.001" value="0.102" required /></label><label>OTP-sats<input name="otpRate" type="number" min="0" max="1" step="0.001" value="0.02" required /></label><button type="submit">Beregn kontrollgrunnlag</button></form>
      <form id="submission-form"><strong>Forbered innsending</strong><label>Type<select name="submissionType"><option value="a_melding">A-melding</option><option value="nav_income">NAV inntektsmelding</option><option value="mva">MVA</option><option value="tax_return">Skattemelding</option><option value="annual_accounts">Årsregnskap</option></select></label><label>Periode<input name="period" required placeholder="2026-08" /></label><button type="submit">Klargjør payload</button><small>Payloaden må godkjennes og sendes via konfigurert adapter.</small></form>
      <form id="approve-form"><strong>Godkjenn kontrollgrunnlag</strong><label>Kontrollgrunnlag<select id="check-select" name="checkId" required></select></label><button type="submit">Godkjenn beregning</button><small>Godkjenning endrer kun intern status. Ekstern innsending er ikke konfigurert.</small></form>
      <form id="approve-submission-form"><strong>Godkjenn innsending</strong><label>Payload<select id="submission-select" name="submissionId" required></select></label><button type="submit">Godkjenn payload</button><small>Sendes ikke automatisk til Altinn eller NAV.</small></form>
    </div><p id="action-status" class="action-status" role="status" hidden></p></section>
    <section class="notice"><strong>Produksjonsgrense</strong><p>Dette er en beregning og et revisjonsspor. Skattekort, A-melding, NAV, OTP-rapportering og bankbetaling krever godkjente Maskinporten-/leverandøravtaler, juridisk kontroll og eksplisitt menneskelig godkjenning.</p></section>
  </main>
</Layout>
<script is:inline>
  const esc=v=>String(v??'').replace(/[&<>'"]/g,c=>({'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;',"'":'&#39;','"':'&quot;'}[c])); const boardId=new URLSearchParams(location.search).get('boardId')||'board-1'; const list=document.getElementById('pay-list'),status=document.getElementById('status'),actionStatus=document.getElementById('action-status'); const money=n=>`${new Intl.NumberFormat('nb-NO').format(Number(n||0)/100)} NOK`; const labels={calculated:'Beregnet',approved:'Godkjent',draft:'Utkast',review:'Til gjennomgang',prepared:'Forberedt',submitted:'Sendt',closed:'Lukket'}; const pill=v=>`<em class="pill">${esc(labels[v]||v||'—')}</em>`; const api=async(path,opt)=>{const r=await fetch(path,opt),d=await r.json();if(!r.ok)throw new Error(d.error||'request_failed');return d};
  const render=(view,rows)=>{list.innerHTML=rows.length?rows.map(r=>view==='runs'?`<article><div><strong>${esc(r.period)} · lønnskjøring</strong><p>${esc(r.employee_count)} ansatte · brutto ${money(r.gross_minor)}</p></div>${pill(r.status)}<small>${esc(r.id)}</small></article>`:view==='submissions'?`<article><div><strong>${esc(r.period)} · ${esc(r.submission_type)}</strong><p>${esc(r.notes||'Internt klargjort')} · hash ${esc(String(r.payload_hash||'').slice(0,12))}…</p></div>${pill(r.status)}<small>${esc(r.id)}</small></article>`:`<article><div><strong>${esc(r.period)} · kontrollgrunnlag</strong><p>${esc(r.employee_count)} ansatte · feriepenger ${money(r.holiday_pay_minor)} · OTP ${money(r.otp_minor)}</p></div>${pill(r.status)}<small>${esc(r.assumptions||'Forutsetninger ikke oppgitt')}</small></article>`).join(''):'<p class="empty">Ingen registrerte rader.</p>'};
  const load=async view=>{try{const d=await api(`/api/payroll?boardId=${encodeURIComponent(boardId)}&view=${view}`);render(view,d.data||[]);status.textContent=`${(d.data||[]).length} poster · kilde synlig`}catch{status.textContent='API utilgjengelig'}};
  const refresh=async()=>{try{const [checks,runs,submissions]=await Promise.all(['checks','runs','submissions'].map(v=>api(`/api/payroll?boardId=${encodeURIComponent(boardId)}&view=${v}`)));const checkRows=checks.data||[];const c=checkRows[0]||{};const run=(runs.data||[]).find(r=>r.period===c.period)||(runs.data||[])[0]||{};document.getElementById('pay-holiday').textContent=money(c.holiday_pay_minor);document.getElementById('pay-otp').textContent=money(c.otp_minor);document.getElementById('pay-net').textContent=money(Number(run.gross_minor||0)-Number(run.tax_withheld_minor||0));document.getElementById('pay-employer').textContent=money(run.employer_cost_minor);document.getElementById('pay-total').textContent=money(Number(c.holiday_pay_minor||0)+Number(c.otp_minor||0));document.getElementById('pay-people').textContent=`${c.employee_count??run.employee_count??'—'} ansatte i grunnlaget`;document.getElementById('pay-holiday-rate').textContent=`Sats ${Number(c.holiday_rate||0)*100}%`;document.getElementById('pay-otp-rate').textContent=`Sats ${Number(c.otp_rate||0)*100}%`;document.getElementById('pay-status').textContent=c.status==='approved'?'Godkjent':'Krever review';document.getElementById('run-select').innerHTML=(runs.data||[]).map(r=>`<option value="${esc(r.id)}">${esc(r.period)} · ${money(r.gross_minor)}</option>`).join('')||'<option value="">Ingen lønnskjøringer</option>';document.getElementById('check-select').innerHTML=checkRows.filter(r=>['calculated','review'].includes(r.status)).map(r=>`<option value="${esc(r.id)}">${esc(r.period)} · ${money(r.holiday_pay_minor)} + ${money(r.otp_minor)}</option>`).join('')||'<option value="">Ingen åpne kontrollgrunnlag</option>';const open=(submissions.data||[]).filter(r=>['prepared','review'].includes(r.status));document.getElementById('submission-select').innerHTML=open.map(r=>`<option value="${esc(r.id)}">${esc(r.period)} · ${esc(r.submission_type)} · ${esc(r.status)}</option>`).join('')||'<option value="">Ingen åpne payloads</option>'}catch{}}
  const post=async(payload)=>{await api('/api/payroll',{method:'POST',headers:{'content-type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify({boardId,...payload})});actionStatus.hidden=false;actionStatus.textContent='Endringen er lagret og auditert.';actionStatus.classList.remove('error');await Promise.all([refresh(),load(document.querySelector('.tabs button.active')?.dataset.view||'checks')])}; const setError=m=>{actionStatus.hidden=false;actionStatus.textContent=m;actionStatus.classList.add('error')};
  document.querySelectorAll('.tabs button').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>{document.querySelectorAll('.tabs button').forEach(x=>x.classList.remove('active'));b.classList.add('active');load(b.dataset.view)}));
  document.getElementById('create-run-form').addEventListener('submit',async e=>{e.preventDefault();const f=new FormData(e.currentTarget);try{await post({action:'create_run',period:f.get('period'),grossMinor:Math.round(Number(f.get('gross'))*100),taxWithheldMinor:Math.round(Number(f.get('tax'))*100),employerCostMinor:Math.round(Number(f.get('employer'))*100),employeeCount:Number(f.get('employees'))});e.currentTarget.reset()}catch(err){setError(err.message==='write_not_authorized'?'Du trenger eier- eller redaktørrolle.':'Lønnskjøringen kunne ikke opprettes.')}});
  document.getElementById('calculate-form').addEventListener('submit',async e=>{e.preventDefault();const f=new FormData(e.currentTarget);try{await post({action:'calculate_compliance',payrollRunId:f.get('runId'),holidayRate:Number(f.get('holidayRate')),otpRate:Number(f.get('otpRate'))})}catch(err){setError(err.message==='write_not_authorized'?'Du trenger eier- eller redaktørrolle.':'Beregningen kunne ikke lagres.')}});
  document.getElementById('submission-form').addEventListener('submit',async e=>{e.preventDefault();const f=new FormData(e.currentTarget);try{await post({action:'prepare_submission',submissionType:f.get('submissionType'),period:f.get('period')});e.currentTarget.reset()}catch(err){setError(err.message==='write_not_authorized'?'Du trenger eier- eller redaktørrolle.':'Payloaden kunne ikke klargjøres.')}}); Promise.all([refresh(),load('checks')]);
  document.getElementById('approve-form').addEventListener('submit',async e=>{e.preventDefault();const f=new FormData(e.currentTarget);try{await post({action:'approve_compliance',checkId:f.get('checkId')});}catch(err){setError(err.message==='write_not_authorized'?'Du trenger eier- eller redaktørrolle.':'Kontrollgrunnlaget kunne ikke godkjennes.')}});
  document.getElementById('approve-submission-form').addEventListener('submit',async e=>{e.preventDefault();const f=new FormData(e.currentTarget);try{await post({action:'approve_submission',submissionId:f.get('submissionId')});}catch(err){setError(err.message==='write_not_authorized'?'Du trenger eier- eller redaktørrolle.':'Payloaden kunne ikke godkjennes.')}});
</script>
<style>
  .pay-shell{max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:38px 24px 80px}.pay-hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr .45fr;align-items:center;gap:24px;padding:44px;border-radius:27px;background:linear-gradient(120deg,#3e374f,#7161a2);color:#fff}.eyebrow,.kicker{font:700 .68rem system-ui,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#ded5ff}.pay-hero h1{margin:20px 0 16px;font:500 clamp(2.5rem,5vw,4.4rem)/.96 Georgia,serif}.pay-hero h1 em{color:#e1d3ff;font-style:normal}.pay-hero p{max-width:570px;color:#ffffffbf;font:1rem/1.6 system-ui,sans-serif}.primary{display:inline-flex;margin-top:22px;padding:13px 17px;border-radius:10px;background:#e1d3ff;color:#40364e;font:700 .78rem system-ui,sans-serif}.pay-orb{width:190px;height:190px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border:1px solid #ded3ffaa;border-radius:50%;background:#514475}.pay-orb strong{font:500 2.35rem Georgia,serif;color:#f0e9ff}.pay-orb span,.pay-orb small{font:.68rem system-ui,sans-serif}.pay-orb small{margin-top:9px;color:#d9cff7}.metrics{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:12px;margin:16px 0 52px}.metrics article{min-height:105px;padding:17px;border:1px solid #10241f14;border-radius:15px;background:#fff;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between}.metrics .dark{background:#10241f;color:#fff}.metrics span,.metrics small{color:#718078;font:600 .67rem system-ui,sans-serif}.metrics strong{font:500 1.5rem Georgia,serif}.workspace{padding:28px;border:1px solid #10241f18;border-radius:20px;background:#fff}.head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:end}.head h2{margin:9px 0 0;font:500 2.1rem Georgia,serif}.head>span{color:#718078;font:.7rem system-ui,sans-serif}.tabs{display:flex;gap:6px;margin:25px 0 12px}.tabs button{padding:10px 14px;border:1px solid #10241f1c;border-radius:9px;background:#fafbf9;color:#65746b;cursor:pointer;font:700 .72rem system-ui,sans-serif}.tabs button.active{background:#7161a2;color:#fff}.workspace article{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.5fr auto auto;gap:12px;align-items:center;padding:15px 4px;border-top:1px solid #10241f12}.workspace strong{font:600 .82rem system-ui,sans-serif}.workspace p,.workspace small{margin:5px 0 0;color:#718078;font:.7rem/1.35 system-ui,sans-serif}.pill{padding:5px 8px;border-radius:999px;background:#eee9ff;color:#65539a;font:700 .61rem system-ui,sans-serif;font-style:normal;white-space:nowrap}.actions{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.7fr 1.3fr;gap:25px;margin-top:32px;padding:28px;border:1px solid #10241f18;border-radius:20px;background:#faf8ff}.actions h2{margin:10px 0 8px;font:500 1.8rem/1.05 Georgia,serif}.actions p{color:#63736a;font:.78rem/1.5 system-ui,sans-serif}.action-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:10px}.action-grid form{display:grid;gap:8px;padding:16px;border:1px solid #10241f14;border-radius:12px;background:#fff}.action-grid strong{font:700 .78rem system-ui,sans-serif}.action-grid label{display:grid;gap:4px;color:#63736a;font:600 .64rem system-ui,sans-serif}.action-grid input,.action-grid select{width:100%;padding:9px;border:1px solid #10241f1c;border-radius:7px;background:#fff;font:.72rem system-ui,sans-serif}.action-grid button{padding:9px;border:0;border-radius:8px;background:#7161a2;color:#fff;cursor:pointer;font:700 .68rem system-ui,sans-serif}.action-grid small{color:#718078;font:.62rem/1.35 system-ui,sans-serif}.action-status{grid-column:1/-1;margin:5px 0 0;padding:9px 11px;border-radius:8px;background:#e2f3e5;color:#286447;font:700 .68rem system-ui,sans-serif}.action-status.error{background:#fae8e5;color:#97443d}.notice{margin-top:35px;padding:22px 25px;border-radius:16px;background:#eeeaff}.notice strong{font:700 .78rem system-ui,sans-serif}.notice p{margin:8px 0 0;color:#63736a;font:.78rem/1.5 system-ui,sans-serif}.empty{color:#718078;font:.75rem system-ui,sans-serif}@media(max-width:800px){.pay-hero{grid-template-columns:1fr}.metrics{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.actions{grid-template-columns:1fr}}@media(max-width:560px){.pay-shell{padding:20px 15px 55px}.pay-hero{padding:28px 22px}.metrics{grid-template-columns:1fr}.workspace{padding:20px 16px}.workspace article{grid-template-columns:1fr auto}.workspace article small{grid-column:1}.action-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.actions{padding:20px 16px}}
</style>
